                                                "sense_id": "a484c18b-ecf0-3016-b011-d320f5e822f0",
                                                "text": "Inside the house, Paul is in the kitchen bent over a bowl of pesto: thick shiny basil leaves, machete-crushed garlic cloves, pine nuts, onions roasted till their gold edges blacken, and the bright scent of lemon zest."
                                            }
